  "limitations": [
    "Actual synthetic signed receipt reconciliation, finalized entitlement/leaf closure and API absence feed the existing queue writer. Only acknowledged retained bytes reach a bounded public ClaimSwarm endpoint; failed/pending writes do not advance its sequence or digest.",
    "Claimed is accepted liability, not payment. ClaimPaid and ClaimPaymentDeferred use exact authoritative ABI identifiers and matching receipt coordinates; full aggregate coldkey amounts may span epochs/operators and are never allocated per pool. Malformed, duplicate, wrong-coordinate or smaller-than-accepted payment observations degrade payment reporting while preserving original finalized signed custody.",
    "All receipt/leaf observations remain configured-RPC assertions and genesis unverified; API no-claim remains an API assertion with unknown payment. No independent native finality, code authority, economics or actual mainnet472 approval is inferred.",
    "Public detail is at most64 entries, ordered oldest unresolved then recent terminal; full bounded-queue counts and omitted unresolved detail remain explicit. Sequence means durable acknowledgement/heartbeat, not settlement progress. Future/invalid observations are omitted without rewriting original custody; byte pressure can omit new or prior optional metadata, never signatures or operational history.",
    "Original unchanged17cc plus test-only56c failed both actual missing-observation boundaries. Intermediateb68 retained a wrong ClaimPaid topic with two positive/one failed root. Final overlays are exact prior capacity source plus narrow prior topic/order expressions; they are not whole-old-source race runs. The prior-order overlay is refused by new complete-census validation rather than claiming an isolated old wire-format rerun.",
    "Exact effective server10a/Connect0a5/sdk5d37 graph only;636 modules and seven local physical Git trees are captured. Later current server/module, provider98/e4 composition, independent claim monitor, contract carry/reserve/payment/native economics and full release qualification remain separate.",
    "Tests use local synthetic keys/RPC/HTTP/files and deterministic after-sync failure/cancellation barriers. No live transaction, deployment, service activation, signing approval or current mainnet authority is performed. Normal/race scope is37 selected roots, not the full miner or protocol suite."
  ],
